{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>My Car My Life is a 2D drag racing game with realistic physics, detailed mechanics, and a 100% Brazilian vibe.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, tune, and race cars that marked generations in Brazil, from the \u201970s to the 2015s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The focus here is on the passion of building your project from scratch! the customization system is technical and demands attention, every engine has its ideal combos, and the game rewards those who know their stuff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You also get the <strong>NoguiinTech</strong>, a hub inspired by FuelTech, where you can adjust ignition, injection, fuel pressure, lambda readings, and more \u2014 all in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>career mode</strong>, you\u2019ll face 12 unique opponents, each with their own style and tuned car. Plus, compete in <strong>seasonal championships</strong> (spring, summer, fall, winter) with categories for both naturally aspirated and turbo engines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>three different tracks</strong> to race on:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abandoned Street</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Largados Racetrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ignorant Highway</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outside the tracks, there\u2019s a <strong>Bar</strong> with three minigames where you can try your luck and earn extra cash to invest in your car.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the engine sounds? They\u2019re a show on their own. Each car has its own unique and realistic roar, both at idle and full throttle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re into real drag racing, building projects, and that raw Brazilian car culture vibe, this game is for you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3933710?t=1772662159","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3933710?t=1772662159","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933710/26ad71179d9349b4da79e706a57b1a7accb980f5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772662159","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933710/26ad71179d9349b4da79e706a57b1a7accb980f5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772662159","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4072860,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>My Car My Life is a 2D drag racing game with realistic physics, detailed mechanics, and a 100% Brazilian vibe.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, tune, and race cars that marked generations in Brazil, from the \u201970s to the 2015s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The focus here is on the passion of building your project from scratch! the customization system is technical and demands attention, every engine has its ideal combos, and the game rewards those who know their stuff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You also get the <strong>NoguiinTech</strong>, a hub inspired by FuelTech, where you can adjust ignition, injection, fuel pressure, lambda readings, and more \u2014 all in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>career mode</strong>, you\u2019ll face 12 unique opponents, each with their own style and tuned car. Plus, compete in <strong>seasonal championships</strong> (spring, summer, fall, winter) with categories for both naturally aspirated and turbo engines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>three different tracks</strong> to race on:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abandoned Street</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Largados Racetrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ignorant Highway</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outside the tracks, there\u2019s a <strong>Bar</strong> with three minigames where you can try your luck and earn extra cash to invest in your car.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the engine sounds? They\u2019re a show on their own. Each car has its own unique and realistic roar, both at idle and full throttle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re into real drag racing, building projects, and that raw Brazilian car culture vibe, this game is for you.</p>","developers":["Noguiin"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933710/1633433a32fe0b16d8e272579a237c946ad2b945/header.jpg?t=1772662159","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu or similar<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 8 Series or Similar Radeon<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.s